  "description": "Ji-woo’s life was picture-perfect. A media mogul husband, a successful career in journalism, and the scoop of the century ready to boost her into the stratosphere—she had everything she could ever want. Only, that scoop? It’s about her husband’s affair with a top actress! Ji-woo flees to the States to start over, but to finalize the divorce, she's forced to return to Korea. That's when her ex-husband presents an offer she just can't refuse...\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
